  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>Q14: Recursion: base case check</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>In the following code, what would happen if the base case check <code>if n == 0</code> was removed?</p>
<pre><code>def f(n):
    # if n == 0: return 1
    return n * f(n - 1)</code></pre>]]></text></questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Without the stopping condition, the function will call itself infinitely until the stack overflows.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1.0</defaultgrade>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html"><text><![CDATA[The function will run until a RecursionError occurs.]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[The function will return 0 immediately.]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[The function will return 1 immediately.]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[The code will compile but won't run.]]></text></answer>
  </question>

  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>Q15: Selection Sort code: min_idx</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Look at this part of Selection Sort:</p>
<pre><code>for i in range(n):
    min_idx = i
    for j in range(i + 1, n):
        if arr[j] < arr[min_idx]:
            min_idx = j</code></pre>
<p>If <code>arr = [5, 2, 8]</code> and <code>i = 0</code>, what is <code>min_idx</code> after the <code>j</code> loop finishes?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>The loop compares 5 to 2 (min_idx becomes 1) and then 2 to 8. Final min_idx is 1.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1.0</defaultgrade>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html"><text><![CDATA[1]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[0]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[2]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[5]]></text></answer>
  </question>
